    "body": "Toad City Baltimore for macOS (unsigned universal arm64 + x86_64 Electron app) + ES-DE kit.\nGame: site/ from `toadcity/integration` @ `a51ef3690f1e9b0a7986ecde0fd647a038f65e25`. Wrapper: `1ff71ced7916fb95cdc7f34c522c7d76126867ef` on toadcity/desktop.\n\nInstall (also sets up ES-DE):\n```\ncurl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bparlette/Hawk/toadcity/desktop/install_mac.sh | bash\n```\nThe app is not Apple-signed. install_mac.sh removes the quarantine; by hand: `xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine ~/Applications/\"Toad City Baltimore.app\"`.\nQuit back to ES-DE: hold Select+Start or Esc for 1 s (or Cmd+Q).\n"
